WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
video file & english subtitles: Safex

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:07.064
In order to learn the nursing techniques
for the surgical department,

00:00:07.214 --> 00:00:13.737
Candy, Franny and the group are going to
take off for St. Joanna Hospital in Chicago.

00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:19.345
The day has come.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:24.483
Heading to the hospital in a big city

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:42.098
I will be farther away from Pony's Home.

00:00:42.275 --> 00:00:48.112
Sister Pony and Sister Lane,
you must be happy for me.

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:58.918
Candy, take care of yourself.
Good luck!

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:08.429
Stear, Archie and Annie.
They are all in Chicago.

00:01:09.369 --> 00:01:13.305
I am going to Chicago.
They must be very surprised.

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:15.004
Candy!

00:01:15.442 --> 00:01:18.235
Candy, can you turn off the light?

00:01:18.385 --> 00:01:20.903
It's late.

00:01:21.253 --> 00:01:23.906
Sorry, I'll turn off the light now.

00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:28.542
Franny, you are not going to write
a letter home?

00:01:28.692 --> 00:01:30.379
To tell them what?

00:01:30.529 --> 00:01:34.187
That I am one of the five chosen people,
so please be happy for me?

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:38.660
Or should I tell them that
it feels lonely to leave here?

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:45.068
I hate being sensitive!

00:01:45.238 --> 00:01:49.730
I only hope to become an
outstanding nurse as soon as possible.

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:51.333
Good night.

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:56.247
Good night.

00:01:56.649 --> 00:01:58.412
Go to sleep!

00:01:58.818 --> 00:02:01.316
We have patients to take care of tomorrow.

00:02:01.555 --> 00:02:03.015
Yes.

00:02:12.866 --> 00:02:16.267
Franny
why don't you want to open your heart?

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:22.837
We will study together in the future.

00:02:39.926 --> 00:02:42.319
Franny, we are so nervous!

00:02:42.469 --> 00:02:45.170
You are going to help us in Chicago, right?

00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:47.061
You too! Please!

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:51.927
She is so cold!

00:02:52.077 --> 00:02:55.163
But Franny works hard
and has good grades.

00:02:55.313 --> 00:02:56.806
We need her.

00:02:57.844 --> 00:03:02.301
St. Joanna Hospital in Chicago
is our headquarters.

00:03:02.451 --> 00:03:05.209
They have a lot of outstanding people there.

00:03:05.359 --> 00:03:10.085
Country nurses like us
will be looked down.

00:03:10.657 --> 00:03:13.247
Especially one of us.

00:03:13.397 --> 00:03:14.313
Candy?

00:03:14.463 --> 00:03:17.954
Franny and her are enemies.

00:03:18.565 --> 00:03:20.259
Good morning!

00:03:21.297 --> 00:03:23.698
Today is our last day here.

00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:28.729
Let's not get too close to Candy.

00:03:28.879 --> 00:03:31.401
It's not good if Franny gets mad.

00:03:38.818 --> 00:03:40.183
Good morning.

00:03:41.287 --> 00:03:43.118
Good morning.

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:45.280
Good morning, Candy!

00:03:45.458 --> 00:03:47.615
Good morning, Miss Betty!

00:03:47.765 --> 00:03:49.451
Candy, good morning!

00:03:49.601 --> 00:03:50.954
Good morning, Miss Simone!

00:03:51.104 --> 00:03:52.652
Candy, good morning!

00:03:52.802 --> 00:03:54.630
Is Aunt better?

00:03:57.036 --> 00:03:58.469
That's great!

00:03:59.205 --> 00:04:01.696
You can leave the hospital soon.

00:04:01.946 --> 00:04:04.301
Candy, sorry for the trouble.
Thank you!

00:04:04.551 --> 00:04:05.971
Candy, good morning!

00:04:06.379 --> 00:04:08.872
Good morning, Miss Tera, Miss Ruth!

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:13.341
Everybody is so nice today.

00:04:13.586 --> 00:04:16.449
We won't see you anymore.

00:04:17.991 --> 00:04:20.387
You are going to a hospital in Chicago,
aren't you?

00:04:21.361 --> 00:04:22.314
I....

00:04:22.464 --> 00:04:26.189
You don't need to hide anymore.
We've all heard.

00:04:26.339 --> 00:04:29.393
You can't hide anything in the hospital.

00:04:36.242 --> 00:04:39.700
Sorry,
I didn't mean to hide things from you.

00:04:40.546 --> 00:04:42.537
I just couldn't say it.

00:04:43.449 --> 00:04:47.315
I know.
We don't want you to leave either.

00:04:49.022 --> 00:04:51.723
Candy, look at these flowers.

00:04:52.292 --> 00:04:55.625
We planted them together last year.

00:04:56.763 --> 00:04:59.691
We don't want you to leave.

00:05:11.944 --> 00:05:13.775
- Silly girl!
- Yes!

00:05:14.247 --> 00:05:15.742
Good luck!

00:05:16.449 --> 00:05:18.741
We will pray for you.

00:05:18.891 --> 00:05:22.082
Right!

00:05:22.388 --> 00:05:24.788
Yes, thank you.

00:05:34.233 --> 00:05:35.029
No.

00:05:35.234 --> 00:05:37.632
I can't cry.

00:05:47.914 --> 00:05:50.436
It's better not to tell the kids.

00:05:50.586 --> 00:05:52.551
I am afraid they can't take it.

00:05:54.253 --> 00:05:55.720
Good morning.

00:05:56.522 --> 00:05:59.617
- Good morning, Candy!
- I finished my breakfast.

00:06:00.067 --> 00:06:01.452
You are so good!

00:06:01.602 --> 00:06:04.922
Candy, I went to the restroom by myself.

00:06:05.072 --> 00:06:06.823
You are great!

00:06:06.973 --> 00:06:09.861
Principal will be so happy about this.

00:06:10.011 --> 00:06:13.090
Candy, we don't need
to take shots today, right?

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:14.467
Right.

00:06:15.308 --> 00:06:17.572
Let me tell you a story.

00:06:20.279 --> 00:06:22.806
But, you promise me to take the medicine
on time.

00:06:23.006 --> 00:06:26.043
Sister Candy, we always take
the medicine on time.

00:06:26.193 --> 00:06:27.619
Good kids.

00:06:28.921 --> 00:06:30.944
These children are so cute.

00:06:31.094 --> 00:06:33.046
I am going to leave them today.

00:06:33.196 --> 00:06:35.052
I can not say it.

00:06:35.202 --> 00:06:38.858
Sister Candy.

00:06:39.365 --> 00:06:41.856
What's wrong? Your face looks weird.

00:06:42.869 --> 00:06:44.837
Nothing.

00:06:45.338 --> 00:06:46.730
It's dangerous!

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:50.206
My face looks so obvious.
I must be careful!

00:06:53.079 --> 00:06:53.968
Franny.

00:06:54.118 --> 00:06:55.335
Candy.

00:06:55.485 --> 00:06:58.807
Did you tell them
there will be a new nurse tomorrow?

00:06:59.007 --> 00:07:00.774
No, not yet.

00:07:00.924 --> 00:07:02.375
Why not?

00:07:02.525 --> 00:07:04.686
The words just couldn't come out.

00:07:05.925 --> 00:07:07.180
But, before we leave....

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:09.620
Forget it. I'll say it for you.

00:07:10.229 --> 00:07:11.961
Franny, no!

00:07:14.033 --> 00:07:15.451
Attention, please!

00:07:15.641 --> 00:07:19.595
Everybody, from tomorrow,
the nurse for this room will be changed.

00:07:21.107 --> 00:07:25.267
Today is Candy's last day.
Please cooperate.

00:07:25.417 --> 00:07:27.501
Why?

00:07:27.651 --> 00:07:30.670
Candy is going to study
in a hospital in Chicago.

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:32.808
- Franny!
- Chicago?

00:07:33.386 --> 00:07:36.509
She is going to leave this hospital?

00:07:36.759 --> 00:07:39.457
I will be back soon.

00:07:40.493 --> 00:07:44.999
Candy, don't mislead the patients.

00:07:45.264 --> 00:07:46.390
But....

00:07:46.933 --> 00:07:48.325
Everyone, listen.

00:07:48.475 --> 00:07:53.701
If we want to be the real nurses,
we need to gain more knowledge.

00:07:54.006 --> 00:07:55.439
You understand?

00:07:58.478 --> 00:08:00.139
Franny!

00:08:02.281 --> 00:08:04.775
Sorry I didn't tell you.

00:08:05.651 --> 00:08:07.744
Everyone, say something!

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:25.869
That's too much!

00:08:26.839 --> 00:08:28.431
Franny is too much!

00:08:37.517 --> 00:08:38.541
Good morning.

00:08:40.019 --> 00:08:43.042
You are going to abandon us!

00:08:43.192 --> 00:08:44.497
Candy is the devil!

00:08:44.847 --> 00:08:46.922
Silly girl! Franny told us.

00:08:47.527 --> 00:08:50.618
Sorry, please let me explain....

00:08:50.768 --> 00:08:53.699
I don't want to see you anymore!
Get out!

00:08:55.868 --> 00:08:57.358
Candy.

00:08:59.372 --> 00:09:03.241
To make the children sad is unforgivable.

00:09:06.045 --> 00:09:08.472
That was dangerous, silly girl!

00:09:08.622 --> 00:09:10.310
I am sorry!

00:09:11.717 --> 00:09:12.975
What's with this attitude?

00:09:13.125 --> 00:09:14.347
Good-bye!

00:09:16.622 --> 00:09:18.720
You are too much, Franny!

00:09:18.991 --> 00:09:23.491
Candy, stop acting.

00:09:23.729 --> 00:09:24.818
Acting?

00:09:24.968 --> 00:09:28.556
That's right.
You were trying to hide your leaving.

00:09:28.706 --> 00:09:31.159
That's what made the patients upset.

00:09:32.505 --> 00:09:37.408
After you leave, how will the patients
ever trust other nurses?

00:09:38.644 --> 00:09:40.768
It's not like that.

00:09:40.918 --> 00:09:43.041
Nursing is a team work.

00:09:43.616 --> 00:09:45.042
No matter who takes over,

00:09:45.192 --> 00:09:49.110
the most important thing is to help
the patients receive the treatment.

00:09:49.322 --> 00:09:54.282
Although they are always against each other,
they both will be good nurses.

00:10:02.034 --> 00:10:04.594
Franny is right.

00:10:05.137 --> 00:10:07.761
I only thought
about how would the patients feel,

00:10:07.911 --> 00:10:10.000
but forgot about my team mates.

00:10:10.943 --> 00:10:13.466
Treatment can not rely on just one person.

00:10:13.616 --> 00:10:17.982
It takes the cooperation between
the doctors and the nurses.

00:10:23.122 --> 00:10:25.352
A letter for me?

00:10:26.993 --> 00:10:28.893
"I am sorry."

00:10:32.932 --> 00:10:34.729
It's my fault!

00:10:36.936 --> 00:10:41.339
I should tell everyone
that I am going to Chicago.

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:53.305
Let's have a farewell party
for Sister Candy!

00:10:53.555 --> 00:10:55.314
- Right!
- Agreed!

00:10:56.155 --> 00:11:00.091
I am going to notify
the patients in the other rooms.

00:11:00.926 --> 00:11:03.003
Good idea! Right, everyone?

00:11:03.153 --> 00:11:04.892
Yes, let's do it!

00:11:06.666 --> 00:11:08.187
Decided.

00:11:08.337 --> 00:11:13.067
We grownups can not cry first.

00:11:13.539 --> 00:11:14.864
That's right!

00:11:15.014 --> 00:11:18.200
Candy has always been encouraging us.

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:21.069
This time we'll encourage her.

00:11:21.219 --> 00:11:24.775
Let's notify the other rooms.

00:11:43.002 --> 00:11:44.162
Coming!

00:11:46.939 --> 00:11:48.796
Principal!

00:11:48.946 --> 00:11:51.365
You finished packing?

00:11:51.515 --> 00:11:53.672
Follow me.

00:11:56.583 --> 00:11:59.013
Natalie and others are over there.

00:11:59.285 --> 00:12:03.080
Principal told us to gather here.

00:12:03.230 --> 00:12:05.616
What's going on here?

00:12:05.766 --> 00:12:07.918
This is the meeting room.

00:12:08.168 --> 00:12:11.890
There won't be anything good happening
in the last test before we leave.

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:16.261
Go in.

00:12:18.003 --> 00:12:19.732
Come, Franny.

00:12:25.478 --> 00:12:28.038
Ready!

00:12:52.238 --> 00:12:53.762
This is....

00:12:54.106 --> 00:12:55.630
Still not know?

00:12:56.108 --> 00:12:58.933
The patients want to thank you.

00:12:59.183 --> 00:13:03.946
Sister Candy, go!
Be an outstanding nurse!

00:13:04.683 --> 00:13:07.941
I will work hard with everybody.

00:13:08.191 --> 00:13:10.750
Franny, you take care!

00:13:11.023 --> 00:13:12.991
Thanks.

00:13:18.097 --> 00:13:21.357
Sister Candy,
thanks for taking care of me.

00:13:21.507 --> 00:13:24.732
I have always been self-centered, sorry.

00:13:25.671 --> 00:13:28.430
No, you are a good kid.

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:31.908
I hope you will get well soon
and become an useful person.

00:13:32.077 --> 00:13:34.204
- Sister Judy!
- Thanks.

00:13:34.914 --> 00:13:36.404
Thanks.

00:13:38.217 --> 00:13:39.582
Thanks.

00:13:39.919 --> 00:13:44.015
Sister Franny,
thank you for taking care of me!

00:13:56.569 --> 00:13:58.196
Franny!

00:14:05.077 --> 00:14:08.213
Everyone, please circle around the table.

00:15:01.901 --> 00:15:04.461
Principal, we are leaving.

00:15:05.671 --> 00:15:07.904
Everyone study hard.

00:15:08.674 --> 00:15:10.868
Take care, Principal.

00:15:12.478 --> 00:15:13.340
Candy.

00:15:15.514 --> 00:15:19.275
Remember not to get silly again.

00:15:19.425 --> 00:15:21.182
Yes.

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:26.548
Time to go.

00:15:27.293 --> 00:15:29.921
- Mark, to the station.
- Yes, sir!

00:15:33.299 --> 00:15:38.892
Good-bye! Take care!

00:15:39.042 --> 00:15:41.063
Good-bye!

00:15:43.676 --> 00:15:45.507
Good-bye!

00:15:49.415 --> 00:15:53.317
Silly girl is gone.
The hospital will be very quiet.

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:56.613
Good-bye!

00:16:33.926 --> 00:16:36.053
Chicago.

00:16:48.574 --> 00:16:51.732
The hospital is on a busy street.
It's so good!

00:16:51.911 --> 00:16:53.701
It's great!

00:16:53.951 --> 00:16:55.840
Come on.

00:16:59.785 --> 00:17:02.276
The hospital is so big!

00:17:06.425 --> 00:17:11.226
The number of patients in Joseph Hospital
can not compare to this one.

00:17:12.331 --> 00:17:13.992
Get out of the way!

00:17:16.368 --> 00:17:18.559
Smells like medicine.

00:17:18.709 --> 00:17:20.428
Ouch!

00:17:20.578 --> 00:17:22.161
Sorry, nurse.

00:17:22.351 --> 00:17:27.003
Sorry, the kid's hand was burned.

00:17:27.253 --> 00:17:28.704
It hurts!

00:17:29.782 --> 00:17:30.735
Excuse me....

00:17:30.885 --> 00:17:34.109
Fill out the forms. Take turns.

00:17:34.259 --> 00:17:35.544
But, it's bleeding....

00:17:35.694 --> 00:17:39.750
It's okay, press the wound, he won't die.

00:17:40.092 --> 00:17:40.984
That's mean!

00:17:41.134 --> 00:17:45.654
I can't treat you personally,
you have to follow the rules.

00:17:45.804 --> 00:17:49.491
Why not treat him first?
He is hurting so much.

00:17:50.269 --> 00:17:53.059
His wound is not severe.

00:17:53.209 --> 00:17:54.264
But....

00:17:54.414 --> 00:17:57.006
There are people waiting in line.

00:17:57.246 --> 00:17:59.132
Candy made trouble again.

00:17:59.282 --> 00:18:00.904
She should mind her own business.

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:07.980
Isn't it the nurses' responsibility
to prevent patients from feeling anxious?

00:18:08.220 --> 00:18:10.151
Who are you people?

00:18:10.323 --> 00:18:13.984
Practice nurses
from Merry Jane Nursing School.

00:18:15.628 --> 00:18:19.005
Merry Jane? Shut up!

00:18:19.205 --> 00:18:22.731
If you are busy, we can help him.

00:18:23.068 --> 00:18:24.522
That's arrogant of you.

00:18:24.672 --> 00:18:27.595
How did headmistress Merry Jane taught you?

00:18:27.745 --> 00:18:31.239
Principal wouldn't allow you to do so.

00:18:31.410 --> 00:18:33.935
Candy, let me help you.

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:36.179
Franny!

00:18:37.182 --> 00:18:39.817
Natalie, help me bring my bag here.

00:18:42.454 --> 00:18:44.285
Please come close.

00:18:44.857 --> 00:18:46.381
Go ahead and listen.

00:18:46.892 --> 00:18:49.622
- That's amazing!
- Thank you for the help.

00:18:53.765 --> 00:18:56.524
Child, look at sister!

00:18:56.674 --> 00:18:57.932
Alcohol!

00:19:01.306 --> 00:19:03.233
Listen, it will hurt a little bit.

00:19:03.383 --> 00:19:07.005
You can stand it. You are a man, right?

00:19:08.380 --> 00:19:10.439
Good.

00:19:14.519 --> 00:19:15.447
Amazing.

00:19:26.231 --> 00:19:27.219
Ok.

00:19:27.369 --> 00:19:29.732
Ok, it doesn't hurt anymore, right?

00:19:30.068 --> 00:19:32.730
Thank you!

00:19:33.372 --> 00:19:36.864
Line up to see the doctor later.

00:19:37.309 --> 00:19:38.770
That's ok.

00:19:41.713 --> 00:19:45.170
The doctor would do the same thing.

00:19:45.320 --> 00:19:48.740
You did it very well.

00:19:48.890 --> 00:19:52.590
Headmistress Merry Jane taught you well.

00:19:59.198 --> 00:20:04.223
St. Joanna Hospital is the biggest
multi-division hospital in Chicago.

00:20:04.373 --> 00:20:07.027
We have a lot of patients.

00:20:07.177 --> 00:20:10.908
Especially the surgical department
that you are assigned to.

00:20:19.117 --> 00:20:21.381
This is your room.

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:25.253
Judy, Natalie and Ellie
will stay in this room.

00:20:25.724 --> 00:20:28.116
Candy and Franny will stay
in the other one.

00:20:28.366 --> 00:20:32.964
Excuse me, why should I be
in the same room with Candy?

00:20:33.599 --> 00:20:37.436
Headmistress Merry Jane requested it.

00:20:39.238 --> 00:20:40.435
I see...

00:20:40.639 --> 00:20:44.730
Take good rest today
you will have a lot to do later.

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:45.809
Yes.

00:21:01.326 --> 00:21:07.356
If it was allowed, Candy wouldn't
want to share a room with Franny, either.

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:09.221
However,

00:21:09.371 --> 00:21:12.493
the cooperation a while ago just revealed that

00:21:12.643 --> 00:21:15.801
Franny is a helper who is much needed here.
